l: Channel` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7) and [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L42) event factory to satisfy the `analytics-ingest` consumer contract.\n\n- **Request Parsing & Tests ([`src/api/requestParsing.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/api/requestParsing.ts), [`test/`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test))**:\n  - Restored `channel` parsing in [`parsePlaceOrderRequest`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/api/requestParsing.ts#L11).\n  - Restored test assertions across [`test/order.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/order.test.ts), [`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/app.test.ts), [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/adapters.test.ts), and [`test/helpers.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/helpers.ts).\n  - Verified with `npm run typecheck`, `npm run arch`, and `npm test` (all 39 tests passing).\n",
